  "boundary": "Exact selected union dispatch and module/token joins identify IgniteBuffTextAction. Header11 consumes common byte/three DWORDs, DWORD, byte, DWORD, raw8, byte, TargetSettings and required signed-length byte payload. MethodSpec517478 carries UnityEngine.Vector2 into the direct raw8 helper: two source DWORD bit patterns are returned packed in RAX and forwarded as RDX, with eight-byte cursor advancement. The helper has no wire object header. Pin its complete fast path and two cold rejoins; external refill/segmented helpers and complete error parity remain outside this contract. Enum contexts add no wire headers. Preserve arbitrary raw bits, independent FF wrapper/target, null versus empty payloads and the final payload length even after a null target. TargetSettings uses the separately pinned bounded target profiles. Static identity is exact and selected source order direct; framing remains structural-only. Ignite/text behavior, authored field meaning, payload encoding, runtime provider choice, suffix-anchor ownership and whole-BuffData EOF remain unresolved."
